<p>Of course Mischief is a white-necked raven, <em>Corvus albicollis</em>, but <em>Corvus corax</em> can also speak, and you can find some examples with a bit of searching: <a href="http://m.youtube.com/#/watch?v=hQxNOFPqidg">http://m.youtube.com/#/watch?v=hQxNOFPqidg</a></p>
<p>Note, though that the SCP-2106 unkindness is rather large to be stable. <em>Corvus corax</em> group in pairs primarily and will generally only gather in larger unkindnesses temporarily to exploit a large food source or drive off a predator.</p>

